#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:62
msgid ""
"The meta tags were fixed: the Twitter accounts are output only when they are "
"set, the card is large for large images and the description is shortened to "
"200 characters."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:67
msgid ""
"The settings of the module are displayed again in the site settings. New "
"settings allow to set the author and the rights of the resources. The size, "
"the type and the alternative text of the image are added, the locale uses "
"the format of Open Graph and the duplicate tags of the module Sharing are "
"removed. A canonical link is added, and the searches are not indexed by the "
"search engines. The date of the documents can be set, the links to the other "
"languages are added and options add the tags for citation and the structured "
"data of schema.org. The setting \"Twitter domain\" was removed."
msgstr ""

