#: src/Form/SiteSettingsFieldset.php:116
msgid "Date of the documents"
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/SiteSettingsFieldset.php:117
msgid ""
"The date is output as date of publication for the search engines, only when "
"it is formatted as year, month, day or date time (ISO 8601). The dates of "
"creation and modification of the records are not used, because they are "
"rarely the date of the document."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/SiteSettingsFieldset.php:132
msgid "Append tags for citation of items (Google Scholar, Zotero, Dublin Core)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/SiteSettingsFieldset.php:133
msgid ""
"The tags of Highwire Press (citation_title, citation_author, "
"citation_pdf_url, etc.) and the values of Dublin Core are added to the pages "
"of items. The authors are the values of the property set above, else "
"dcterms:creator. A tag appended by another module, for example Resource "
"Meta, is not duplicated."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/SiteSettingsFieldset.php:144
msgid "Append structured data (schema.org)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/SiteSettingsFieldset.php:145
msgid ""
"The data are appended as json-ld to the pages of resources and of the site, "
"with the same values than the other tags. The type is set from the resource "
"class, for example Book or ImageObject, else CreativeWork. They are skipped "
"when another module appends data of schema.org."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/SiteSettingsFieldset.php:157
msgid "Parameters of the lists not to index"
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/SiteSettingsFieldset.php:158
msgid ""
"A list with one of these parameters in its url is marked \"noindex, follow\" "
"for the search engines, for example a full text search or a sorted list. The "
"lists filtered by a property, a class or an item set are indexed when their "
"parameters are not set here. Leave empty to index all lists."
msgstr ""

